# ART-ALL06 -- W3-FIX-A art acceptance. ALL06 (URBAN, Washington DC): the White House and the memorials stand (no black tile holes); the TaskForce Terror Drones are resolvable.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL06U.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert art.missing == 0
cheat view_building CAWASH01
wait 2
shot whitehouse
cheat view_building CAWSH12
wait 2
shot monument
